 medicine which we call a clinical  biologist  other clinical biologists with specific  competence in biochemistry  hematology or microbiology work in their  respective sectors  all are independent contractors thus  only have a functional authority with  the team managers  and the lab technicians working in their  respective sectors  together with the team managers the  clinical biologist organizes the  sector's activities and develop  and define the tests that are to be used  the hierarchical authority is exercised  by the labs executive manager  for the administrative aspects of hr  management  and by the scientific manager in  collaboration with the clinical  biologist for the scientific validation  of the test  all the lab activities are supported by  ancillary functions  such as quality assurance i.t and  various  administrative tasks the financial  engineer is provided by the financial  department of the hospital and supplies  financial data  on the lab's activities this allows  management based on objective and  measurable indicators  the pulse medical head the executive  manager  and the financial engineer constitute  the polls management trial  and that brings us to the financial  aspects of the job and understanding the  constraints we must face  the basic concept that underlies our  social security system in belgium is  solidarity  this solidarity is guaranteed because  all working people must contribute  to the system based on their salary and  all citizens contribute through this  taxes  thus the funding is provided by three  sources the state  the employers and the workers more  recently  a fourth source of financing is a  percentage of vat receipts and  additional excise duties  the national social security office  collects all those revenues  and distributes them among the seven  branches of social security  among those seven branches is the  compulsory insurance for all belgian  citizens for medical care and benefits  its budget was over 27 billion 